<p>If you are inclined, I hope you will consider leaving an honest review on the platforms of your choice. Reviews on <a href="https://www.amazon.com/stores/Kate-Courtright/author/B08675D3FF?isDramIntegrated=true&amp;ref=ap_rdr&amp;shoppingPortalEnabled=true&amp;store_ref=ap_rdr"><strong>Amazon</strong></a>, <a href="https://www.goodreads.com/author/show/19932939.Kate_Courtright?from_search=true&amp;from_srp=true"><strong>Goodreads</strong></a>, and <a href="https://www.bookbub.com/authors/kate-courtright"><strong>Bookbub</strong></a> are particularly helpful to me. Please know that while I love five star reviews, I don’t expect them from members of my ARC Team. </p>
<p>If you notice any errors in the text or anything you would like to bring to my attention before publication, I would be grateful. I know it’s impossible to have an error-free manuscript, but I’d like this to be as close as possible.</p>
